  "historyNote": "#7149, eff 12-7-99, EXPIRED: 12-7-07 New. #9070, INTERIM, eff 1-11-08, EXPIRED: 7-9-08 New. #9254, eff 9-6-08; ss by #12157, eff 4-7-17",
